307	<li>The Fortress Language Specification, version 1.0 (March 2008), and its Working Draft of 2 February 2011.</li>
308	<li>The revised specification: "Overloading and Multiple Dispatch", "Types", "Static Parameters", "Conversions and Coercions", "Numbers", "Components and APIs", Appendix I and "Proposed Features".</li>
